        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Gaipui ram ninga kabam thui,",
            "Ai puai tat sini gaimei ariu mak;",
            "Ai lungpui ram hei patlou puinung tang puni,",
            "Ai kap dat lak khe.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Ai ningmei ram2!- munpuang rui padikge,",
            "Rianramei 2!- nai mak nangpan rui;",
            "Guang tupui ram gaimei ram la puni.",
            "",
            "2. Ai nruai kum samthai ethei,",
            "Tingkauh thu 2!- ai hei sam talana;",
            "Kalvari chingbut banrao thing rukhou 2!-,",
            "Ai guang tou jao ni e.",
            "",
            "3. Champan jianmei bam chamm ethei,",
            "Chunsi jangsimei hei kim puni cho?",
            "Chunsi jangsimei hei kim kasuan pulak ge,",
            "Kapmei ni tan mak.",
            "",
            "4. Chunsi jangsimei khang sulou,",
            "Kauh Raguang rui suaihiammei rui gaina;",
            "Bumang kandih thu 2!- bam cham lou puni e,",
            "Kandih kathan thu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
